ary to February 35 times in 75 years, the most of any pair. On the middle of the grids, November to December 2025 came in at 63% of normal, while August to September 2025 hit 131%. Every grid had its driest year in 2007, with grid 19387 at 64%. The preliminary August to September 2026 estimate for grid 19687 sits at 82.8.</p>"}
